        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="detail" value="&lt;b&gt;과제 상세 / 등록·수정&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot;&gt;/assignments/new, /&amp;lt;id&amp;gt;, /&amp;lt;id&amp;gt;/edit&lt;br&gt;체크리스트·오늘 지정·메모·파일&lt;br&gt;학습 계획·자동 재계획&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#E9F2EB;strokeColor=#7BA58A;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#24352E;fontSize=15;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=14;" vertex="1" parent="1">
